{'symbol': 'AMT', 'date': '2021-12-21 18:38:00', 'title': 'VOYA FINANCIAL SET TO JOIN S&P MIDCAP 400', 'text': 'NEW YORK, DEC. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P DOW JONES INDICES WILL MAKE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES TO THE S&P MIDCAP 400: VOYA FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: VOYA) WILL REPLACE CORESITE REALTY CORP. (NYSE: COR) IN THE S&P MIDCAP 400 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON TUESDAY, DECEMBER 28. S&P 500 / 100 CONSTITUENT AMERICAN TOWER CORP. (NYSE: AMT) IS ACQUIRING CORESITE REALTY IN A DEAL EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED SOON PENDING FINAL CLOSING CONDITIONS.'}